          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The
            %strong localization of a space
            (really:
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type"} homotopy type
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%E2%88%9E-groupoid"} ∞-groupoid
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectrum"} spectrum
            with respect to some
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/prime+numbers"} prime numbers
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+theory"} homotopical
            analogue of the notion of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/localization+of+a+commutative+ring"} localization of a commutative ring
            (or rather of
            = succeed ")," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/localization+of+a+module"} localization of a module
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi ℤ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Z}
            of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/integers"} integers
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/prime+numbers"} prime numbers
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+groups"} homotopy
            and/or
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homology+groups"} homology groups
            as algebraic localization. (For spaces, there are multiple inequivalent notions of localization, although all agree on
            = succeed ".)" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nilpotent+spaces"} nilpotent spaces
          %p
            Localization in this sense is closely related to
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bousfield+localization"} Bousfield localization
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bousfield+localization+of+spectra"} Bousfield localization of spectra
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/completion+of+a+space"} completion of a space
          %h2#preliminaries Preliminaries
          %h3#sets_of_primes Sets of primes
          %p For all of this page,
          %ul
