          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li#Sullivan70
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dennis+Sullivan"}> Dennis Sullivan
                ,
                %em Localization, Periodicity and Galois Symmetry
                (The 1970 MIT notes) edited by
                = succeed "," do
